{"id":"5e3dbd32e18bca1b","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-comb9-uniformization-function.md","title":"ZFC Comb9 Uniformization Function","display":"df-zfc-comb9-uniformization-function — ZFC Comb9 Uniformization Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb9-uniformization-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb9-uniformization-function"],"display":"df-zfc-comb9-uniformization-function — ZFC Comb9 Uniformization Function","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb9-uniformization-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb9-uniformization-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb9-uniformization-function — ZFC Comb9 Uniformization Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,c,L,S,\\theta\\in V\">\\(f,c,L,S,\\theta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal P:V\\to V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9UniformizationFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9UniformizationFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}uniformization\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9UniformizationFunction}_S(f,c,L,S,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\bigl(\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(L,S,\\mathcal P(\\bigcup S)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(c,S,\\mathcal P((\\bigcup S)\\times\\theta)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\Bigl(\nL(\\delta)\\subseteq\\delta\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c(\\delta),L(\\delta),\\theta)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\left(f,\\bigcup_{\\delta\\in S}L(\\delta),\\theta\\right)\n\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\exists\\xi\\in\\delta\\;\\forall\\eta\\in L(\\delta)\\setminus\\xi\\;\n\\bigl(f(\\eta)=c(\\delta)(\\eta)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}uniformization\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9UniformizationFunction}_S(f,c,L,S,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\bigl(\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(L,S,\\mathcal P(\\bigcup S)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(c,S,\\mathcal P((\\bigcup S)\\times\\theta)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\Bigl(\nL(\\delta)\\subseteq\\delta\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c(\\delta),L(\\delta),\\theta)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\left(f,\\bigcup_{\\delta\\in S}L(\\delta),\\theta\\right)\n\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\exists\\xi\\in\\delta\\;\\forall\\eta\\in L(\\delta)\\setminus\\xi\\;\n\\bigl(f(\\eta)=c(\\delta)(\\eta)\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 都被类型化为函数；最后一项表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 在每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\delta)\">\\(L(\\delta)\\)</span> 的尾部与颜色函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(\\delta)\">\\(c(\\delta)\\)</span> 一致。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"